    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 He sneaked into Innadril where Eva's religion was widely practiced, and caused confusion by threatening the Goddess of Water's followers. The servant of Elder Cronos lives in the Hunters' Village. In order to obtain ingredients for the wonder drug of happiness that Cronos is making, he came to Innadril. After losing himself in daydreams of the world, Mumu forgot why he came here, and hasn't returned to Cronos because he is afraid of being scolded. Animals Lv. 4 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Animals. P. Crit. Rate +25 Speed +5 P. Def. -5% Resistance to Bleed -15% Resistance to Speed Down +20% Resistance to Bow -10% Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
